              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 2:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jom'okadho i royo joyengo wiy gin aka joyeto Yesu ni, “Ha! In am'onwaŋo ikidho kedho Ot pa Were t'igero man i ndelo adek! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere palor ye wi musalaba ibothere wanen!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jotel pa jocway ri Were i wi migam kodi jotel pa ji kodi jondiko bende jonyero Yesu munyo joŋalo go ni, “Obotho joman, to won kinyal bothere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi wanen paka Kristo, Kere pa Joisiraili won olori wi musalaba, aka wanoyey go.” Aka kiri jom'ogur wi musalaba gine bende joyeto go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
