              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo piny kidho yutho, Yozefu ma wok Arimatheya otundo. Go oyido obedo ŋata nigi dwoŋ swa i kweth pa jopido, aka onwaŋo kuro bino pa Ker pa Were. Ndelo no onwaŋo obedo ndelo ma yikirok (dwoŋ mere ni, ndelo ma telo Sabato). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno Yozefu otimo miseni to kidho bongi Pilato to kwayo go delkwoŋ Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato ouro swa ni Yesu otieko tho. Olwoŋo jalweny madwoŋ to penjo go ka Yesu otieko tho adieri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo otieko winjo bongi jalweny madwoŋ ni apaka obedo, Pilato oyeyo Yozefu kwanyo delkwoŋ Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yozefu ogamo delkwoŋ Yesu wi musalaba, otweyo gi suka, to ketho i kaliel m'ogor i tele. Oŋilo kidi madwoŋ to culo gine dhok kaliel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maria ma wok Magdala kodi Maria min Yose onwaŋo jonitie kenyo joneno kam'oyik'iye Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
